  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering av utarbetande av s.k. twinning proposal for partnership samt genomf&#xF6;rande av presentation av f&#xF6;rslaget. F&#xF6;rslaget avser ett EU_Phare twinning projekt LT/2001/IB/EN/02, Radiation Protection i Litauen.I samband med att Sverige tillsammans med Finland f&#xE5;tt uppdrag att genomf&#xF6;ra projektet, till&#xE4;ggsfinansiering f&#xF6;r utarbetande av s k twinning covenant</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support towards the preparation of a twinning proposal for partnership and the presentation of the proposal. The proposal is for a EU-Phare project LT/2001/IB/EN/02, Radiation Protection in Lithuania. Additional funding has been approved for development of a twinning covenant together with Finland and Lithuanian Authorities</narrative>
